# Purpose
Explains how to capture meeting purpose, decisions, action items, notes, and
outcomes.

# Key Sections
- Before the meeting.
- Capture the purpose.
- Record decisions clearly.
- Track action items.
- Separate notes from outcomes.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Do not turn rough discussion into confirmed decisions unless the notes say so.

